<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RMI Titanium initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RMI Titanium initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Pacific Crest Securities said it initiated coverage of RMI Titanium Co with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>- Brokerage sees strong demand for the company's titanium products in the aerospace industry.</p>
<p>- EPS estimates are $1.45 for 1996 and $1.90 in 1997 vs. a loss of $0.30 in 1995.</p>
</text>
